---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Terms"
  description="Terms of use for the Cosmix Engineering website. Product information is for selection enquiries and is not itself a quotation."
  path="/terms"
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="Terms" title="Using this website." lede="A short set of terms for visitors. Have them reviewed before relying on them as a contract." />
  <article class="wrap max-w-3xl py-12 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
    <p>Pages on this site describe equipment and services so you can ask for a quotation. A capacity range on a product page is not an offer to supply that capacity at a stated price.</p>
    <p>Each product page describes the series named on that page. Event photographs show Cosmix Engineering at those occasions.</p>
    <p>The site is published by Cosmix Engineering (Pvt.) Ltd., C-25, Block 4, Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Karachi, Pakistan.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
